      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹8.57 (up from ₹7.10 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹212.3b (up 31% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹92.1b (up 21% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 43% (down from 47% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 29% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 11% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
